  "title": "Belgium: TotalEnergies and Holcim inaugurate Europe’s largest floating solar power plant dedicated to self-consumption",
  "summary": "Paris/Obourg, March 20, 2026 – TotalEnergies and Holcim, a leading player in sustainable construction, inaugurated today in Belgium a floating solar power plant with a capacity of 31 MW, located in Obourg on a former chalk quarry site that has been rehabilitated into a lake. The solar power plant produces 30 GWh per year of renewable electricity, […]",
